# Copy to supabase/.env for local `supabase functions serve --env-file supabase/.env`.
# Never commit the real file. SUPABASE_URL, SUPABASE_ANON_KEY and
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY are injected automatically into Edge Functions,
# both locally and on the hosted project, so they do not belong here.
#
# Add third-party secrets used by future functions below, e.g.:
# SOME_PROVIDER_API_KEY=replace-me
